OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy to start
OL,6,FSunday with outbreaks of rain. Drier
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon with some bright
OL,8,Fspells developing. Feeling pleasant in
OL,9,Fthe sunshine and light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloud increasing overnight,
OL,12,Fwith showery rain arriving from the
OL,13,Fwest, this potentially heavy at times.
OL,14,FA rather mild night under the blanket
OL,15,Fof cloud with light westerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FCloudy Monday with outbreaks
OL,18,Fof light patchy rain through the
OL,19,Fmorning and afternoon, becoming more
OL,20,Fpersistent later and then heavy as it
OL,21,Fpushes south overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
