OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBand
OL,6,Fof rain clearing to sunny spells and
OL,7,Fscattered showers Tuesday. Showers
OL,8,Fexpected to persist through Wednesday
OL,9,Fand Thursday. Temperatures closer to
OL,10,Faverage.
